## Tests

See [docs/TESTING.md](docs/TESTING.md). New code comes with tests; bug fixes come with a
regression test; stale tests are updated to the new requirement, never weakened.

## Documentation

- Behavior change → `README.md` and the relevant `docs/`
- New env var → `.env.example`, the profile's `ENV_REQUIRED_VARS`, and the release matrix
- Architecture change → `docs/architecture/`
- Breaking change → a migration note in the PR and the release changelog

## Getting help

Questions and blockers go to {{HELP_CHANNEL}}. Check `docs/` first.
